      "text": "Flamenco Island"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:5a4836cca1208c95",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "ec43cbbf9ba6bd0643d390dabe37d296bca1d30a478bd7e504813c73396c0339",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261110-fu6s4admm3",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "After you arrive at Panama’s international airport, your charter captain will meet you. The transfer to the port on Flamenco Island takes about an hour.\n\nThe yacht will be waiting at anchor. Once aboard, you can settle in, get to know the yacht and meet the crew. Welcome drinks and dinner prepared by the yacht’s chef are served on the first evening."
    },
