        "runId": "ada-en-20261110-fu6s4admm3",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "Shelter Bay"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:569e72e117968fcc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "544c2fef7726aa152269c95a0ab56280148cc0577b390171bafe7cc18700724f",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261110-fu6s4admm3",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "A Panamanian pilot joins the crew today to guide the yacht through the Panama Canal.\n\nThe route starts in the Pacific Ocean and follows the canal to the Atlantic coast. After the transit, the yacht arrives at Shelter Bay in northern Panama.\n\nFrom here, the journey continues towards San Blas, roughly 65 miles east along Panama’s northern coast."
